    rdf:predicate <urn:reckons:story/content> ;
    rdf:object "Imagine asking a local model to explain your course notes or compare claims in your research. Follow its evidence, correct a mistaken connection and keep your own questions. Smaller models can be candidates for bounded tasks; larger models can help with complex synthesis. Useful access and learning gains must be tested on people's actual devices." ;
