    rdf:object "The funding case is a community-directed way to learn, research and coordinate with knowledge people control. Let participants choose the tasks and decisions. Compare manual work, smaller models and larger models; measure useful answers, corrections, effort and access on real devices. Resolve the open requirements before presenting the pilot as ready." ;
